Some words belong in the room.
Constitution Day / September 17

This Constitution Day, put the Preamble where it can be read again.

Thomas Broadside Co. brings the founding documents into the rooms where we li=
ve, learn, and work. The Preamble, the Declaration, and the Bill of Rights ar=
e set in Caslon, with the source on the sheet.

Behind the catalog is our family print shop in Austin, Texas. Our new one-min=
ute film brings the working presses, the founding story, and the Western Cano=
n together. Hear the machinery. Follow the words.

Then find the words your room has been waiting for.

Discover the Preamble:
https://thomasbroadside.co/documents/preamble-to-the-constitution.html?utm_so=
